---
title: Cloud 2. Initial portfolio synchronization
config:
  theme: default
  themeCSS: |
    text[y="-25"] {
      font-size: 28px !important;
      font-weight: 700 !important;
      text-anchor: middle !important;
    }
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Browser as Next.js Client<br/>(Browser)
    participant Supabase as Supabase<br/>(Auth / Postgres)
    participant Dexie as Local Persistence<br/>(Dexie / IndexedDB)

    Note over Browser,Supabase: Trigger: Browser receives an authenticated user<br/>after the OAuth callback
    Browser->>Browser: Start initial cloud synchronization

    par Read local portfolios
        Browser->>Dexie: Read all saved portfolios
        Dexie-->>Browser: Local portfolios
    and Read cloud portfolios
        Browser->>Supabase: Select the user's portfolios
        Supabase-->>Browser: Cloud portfolios allowed by RLS
    end

    loop Each portfolio ID in the combined set
        alt Portfolio exists only locally, or local updatedAt is newer
            Browser->>Supabase: Upsert local portfolio
            Supabase-->>Browser: Upsert acknowledged
        else Portfolio exists only in the cloud, or cloud updatedAt is newer
            Browser->>Dexie: Store cloud portfolio locally
            Dexie-->>Browser: Write acknowledged
        else Local and cloud updatedAt values are equal
            Note over Browser: Leave both copies unchanged
        end
    end

    Browser->>Dexie: Read the requested or most recently accessed portfolio
    Dexie-->>Browser: Active portfolio
    Browser-->>User: Display portfolio and cloud-sync status
